er corruption separately in each examples mode. Syntax and whitespace checks pass. No full atlas or hosted build is present locally; complete hosted CI and actual timing remain required. The retained prior source-run log is historical baseline evidence, not a matched performance claim. Rebased onto approved final main 019d341 after the preceding CI optimizations. Final exact-head full CI, timing evidence and normal queue integration remain required; no deployment or dataset changes.\n\nRefs #694\n","created_at":"2026-10-04T01:15:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T02:38:22Z","closed_at":"2026-10-04T02:38:21Z","merged_at":"2026-10-04T02:38:21Z","merge_commit_sha":"73cd687bf5386952adae618b1df482b92768106f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChengshuLi/WorldAtlas/pulls/696/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChengshuLi/WorldAtlas/pulls/696/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChengshuLi/WorldAtlas/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChengshuLi/WorldAtlas/issues/696/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChengshuLi/WorldAtlas/statuses/a368cdbdb2e651bd0261515a930bdb480333d72b","head":{"label":"ChengshuLi:engineering/parity-hoist-694-20261004","ref":"engineering/parity-hoist-694-20261004","sha":"a368cdbdb2e651bd0261515a930bdb480333d72b","user":{"login":"ChengshuLi","id":6732996,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MzI5OTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6732996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi","html_url":"https://github.com/ChengshuLi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/starred{/owner}{/re